<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="7" background-color="accent" padding="34pt 12pt 30pt">
      <p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p>
      <spacer mode="fill"/>
      <p role="caption">OWNERSHIP</p>
      <p role="caption">08 / 10</p>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="53" padding="30pt 40pt 26pt 36pt">
      <labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels>
      <h2>Ownership follows outcomes, systems, and operating continuity</h2>
      <p>Replace role labels with verified people and deputies before handover acceptance.</p>
      <table borders="rows" striped="false" col-widths="[20,14,26]">
        <tr><th>Role</th><th>Stance</th><th>Owned outcome or continuity duty</th></tr>
        <tr><td background-color="palette-3"><p font-size="sm"><b>Product Owner</b></p></td><td background-color="palette-3"><p font-size="sm"><b>Accountable</b></p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Outcomes, scope, thresholds, launch authority, and D-04.</p></td></tr>
        <tr><td><p font-size="sm"><b>Incoming Project Manager</b></p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Responsible · coordinating</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Integrated plan, RAID record, decision forum, evidence index, and acceptance.</p></td></tr>
        <tr><td><p font-size="sm"><b>Outgoing Project Manager</b></p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Responsible to T+10</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Context transfer, reconciliation, introductions, and historical clarification.</p></td></tr>
        <tr><td><p font-size="sm"><b>Technical Lead</b></p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Responsible</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Configuration, routing, integrations, release execution, and rollback.</p></td></tr>
        <tr><td><p font-size="sm"><b>Operations Lead</b></p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Responsible</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Training, supervisor readiness, launch coverage, and adoption.</p></td></tr>
        <tr><td><p font-size="sm"><b>Data Lead</b></p></td><td background-color="palette-2"><p font-size="sm"><b>Responsible · A-06</b></p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Export benchmark, dashboard reconciliation, monitoring, and reporting fallback.</p></td></tr>
        <tr><td><p font-size="sm"><b>Security Reviewer</b></p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Consulted</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Production roles, audit controls, and exception review.</p></td></tr>
        <tr><td><p font-size="sm"><b>Support Supervisors</b></p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Consulted · informed</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Workflow validation, override use, and frontline feedback.</p></td></tr>
      </table>
      <aside variant="success"><p font-size="sm"><b>Continuity gate:</b> named deputies for Product Owner, Technical Lead, and Operations Lead; production and reporting access for the incoming team; accepted ownership of every recurring meeting, dashboard, and escalation duty.</p></aside>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>